  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1560
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "前后出现 because, therefore, however, instead,",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1561
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "moreover, also 或隐含逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1562
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1563
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Logical relation：句子之间的因果、转折、递进等",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1564
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "关系。",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1565
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先说清前后是什么关系，再选句子。”",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1566
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 七选五很多正确答案不是靠词汇，而是靠逻辑方向。",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1567
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1568
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 给空前一句贴标签：观点/原因/问题/例子。",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1569
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 给空后一句贴标签。",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1570
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 判断两者关系：同向补充、相反、原因→结果、概括→例子。",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1571
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 选能承担桥梁关系的句子。",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1572
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1573
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "纠结选项写 A/B 再逐条验指代与逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1574
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1575
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· however/yet → 前后方向应有反差",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1576
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· therefore/as a result → 前面应提供原因",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1577
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· for example → 前面应有概括",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1578
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· in addition/moreover → 前面已存在同方向信息",
      "sourcePage": 56,
      "sourceIndex": 1579
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 连接词的逻辑与上下文方向一致。",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1580
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 没有显性连接词时，用“为什么下一句会接着说这个？”判断隐含逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1581
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1582
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "空后：For example, a ten-minute walk can improve concentration. 空前应先提出“small amounts of",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1583
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "movement can help the brain”这类概括。",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1584
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1585
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只按关键词匹配，不管转折方向。",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1586
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· however 前后却是完全同义重复。",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1587
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1588
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 逻辑方向对吗？",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1589
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 连接词有前提吗？",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1590
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： 7-P 代词指代｜7-L 逻辑关系｜7-T 主题链",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1591
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜7-O 位置不合理｜7-R 内容重复。",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1592
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1593
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 先定逻辑，再选句。",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1594
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1596
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. however 表？",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1597
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. therefore 表？",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1598
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. moreover 表？",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1599
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. for example 表？",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1600
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 连接词逻辑和前后句不匹配，选项能留吗？",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1601
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 转折；2. 因果/结果；3. 递进补充；4. 举例；5. 不能。",
      "sourcePage": 57,
      "sourceIndex": 1602
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— G3 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“G3”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 57,
